Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:36.34,Kick,,0,0,0,,STATE · EXPLAINED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:36.34,Title,,0,0,0,,MUMBAI MAY BAN\NFIRECRACKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:36.34,Foot,,0,0,0,,Source: LiveLaw · Republic · Free Press Journal\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}ORDER RESERVED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Mumbai may see a full ban on selling and making firecrackers. The High Court has kept its order for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:10.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The two judges said the police are helpless against illegal bursting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:13.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}They kept their order for later, so this is not yet a ban.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:17.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The court may allow only community displays at fixed grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.87,0:00:20.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Reports say the order could cover all of Maharashtra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:21.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:26.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Reports say there were more than three hundred fires linked to crackers in Mumbai during Diwali.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:32.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A petitioner also says some so called green crackers carry fake codes and banned chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:36.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The court asked about licences and green cracker claims.
